---
title: "Advanced Professional Nursing Concepts"
code: "NSG-230"
category: "nursing"
credits: "2"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/NSG-210"
  - "2026/NSG-211"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisites: NSG 210, NSG 211"
---

Develops the role of the professional nurse in the healthcare environment in preparation for practice as a registered nurse. Introduces leadership and management concepts and focuses on the integration of professional behaviors in a variety of healthcare settings. Lecture 2 hours. Total 2 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
